Taken from keybr.com (unmodified, in data/raw/, embedded into data/*.js):
  - English phonetic model   packages/keybr-phonetic-model/assets/model-en.data
  - English word list        packages/keybr-content-words/lib/data/words-en.json
  - English word blacklist   packages/keybr-phonetic-model/lib/blacklist/blacklist-en.json

Reimplemented in plain JavaScript from keybr.com's source:
  - js/phonetic.js   phonetic model reader, word generator, blacklist censor
  - js/text.js       guided-lesson word selection and punctuation
  - js/lesson.js     per-key timing and miss rules (histogram)
  - js/keystats.js   smoothed per-key speed
  - js/progression.js  confidence-based key unlocking and focus

Original to this project: home-row start and unlock order, permanent unlocks,
reload-safe persistence, import/export, and the user interface.
